<title>DUBAI: TABLE-Bank Muscat Al Ahli raises H1 net.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Bank Muscat Al Ahli raises H1 net.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			    (million Omani rials)</p>
<p> Net profit			     6.000	vs	3.609</p>
<p> Net interest income		  9.022	vs	6.553</p>
<p> Other operating income	     2.866	vs	2.203</p>
<p> Net operating income		11.888	vs	8.756</p>
<p> Other operating expenses	   4.767	vs	4.213</p>
<p> Provisions			     0.610	vs	0.450</p>
<p> Shareholders funds		  33.437	vs     28.789</p>
<p> Total assets			 496.869	vs    366.014</p>
<p>Full name: Bank Muscat Al Ahli Al Omani SAOG.</p>
<p>Note - The figures are unaudited.</p>
<p>-- Dubai newsroom +9714 6071 222</p>
</text>
